  "description": "Her twelfth life arrived after passing through eleven regressions. What awaited her every time she turned back the clock was her husband’s unilateral demand for a divorce. \n\nMax Russell. The grandson of a great revolutionary hero, the son of a notorious con artist, and a successful young businessman who overcame his shameful past. \n\nFreya Russell. The only daughter of a Duke, who voluntarily gave up her high-born life because she was madly in love with that very husband. In every past life, whenever Max declared he wanted a divorce, Freya would cling to him like a madwoman. But this time, she lays down her obsession and accepts Max’s “sincerity” for the first time. \n\n“Fine. Let’s get a divorce.” \n\nFacing Max, who is visibly shaken by her unexpected answer, Freya sets just one condition. \n\n“But in exactly two years.” In the time remaining, Freya engages in a final battle against a new\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=845689), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13471913)",
